{"version":1,"content":"<p>路透社報道，美國傳媒推算，民主黨可望重奪眾議院控制權。</p><p>英國廣播公司（BBC）引述哥倫比亞廣播公司（CBS）推算，民主黨將取得最少218席，共和黨則將取得最少160席。</p><p>（路透社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T04:25:12.253416+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T03:30:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:18:27.434821+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:18:37.971373+00:00","content_hash":"a99e9507194f0b82f64d99e03a64b8b6943da3380758ee8bd59754fa28d30244","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}